15:32.581 --> 15:33.377
Huh?!

15:42.725 --> 15:45.387
It's a brisk morning!

15:45.661 --> 15:47.830
Well, moving on to the next part.

15:47.830 --> 15:49.764
Behoimi, please read.

15:54.503 --> 15:56.439
Hey, magical girl.

15:56.439 --> 15:57.668
Y-Yes!

15:57.840 --> 16:00.176
I'm sorry. I wasn't paying attention...

16:00.176 --> 16:00.276
I'm sorry. I wasn't paying attention...

16:00.276 --> 16:03.212
It's unusual for you not to
pay attention, isn't it?

16:03.212 --> 16:05.047
Maybe it's because I played shadow tag
by myself yesterday.

16:05.047 --> 16:07.709
Maybe it's because I played shadow tag
by myself yesterday.

16:07.950 --> 16:09.440
Don't do creepy things like that.

16:11.987 --> 16:15.324
Man, the weather is too frickin' nice.
I can't stand it.com

16:15.324 --> 16:18.794
Exactly, meow. It's exigent, meow.

16:18.794 --> 16:21.931
You're right. It's exigent.

16:21.931 --> 16:24.567
What's "exigent" anyway?

16:24.567 --> 16:29.071
Follow me. I'll explain it to you
while we drink something.

16:29.071 --> 16:30.334
Cool.

16:36.078 --> 16:39.482
Maybe I should quit being a magical girl...

16:39.482 --> 16:40.483
Why do I have to do this, too? I'm a teacher!

16:40.483 --> 16:43.976
Why do I have to do this, too? I'm a teacher!

16:44.120 --> 16:46.422
Hello, people who are one lap behind me!

16:46.422 --> 16:48.991
About the only thing you're good at
is sports, aren't you?

16:48.991 --> 16:50.720
Don't say "ONLY"!

16:51.026 --> 16:52.962
Tonight, we'll all meet at 7, okay?

16:52.962 --> 16:53.729
What?

16:53.729 --> 16:55.231
Are we going to do that again?!

16:55.231 --> 16:56.499
We'll use this tonight!

16:57.433 --> 16:59.135
"Inyou-michi"?

16:59.135 --> 17:00.469
It's "Onmyou-dou"!

17:00.469 --> 17:02.471
Maho! I was a little off, huh?

17:02.471 --> 17:03.939
YOU WERE COMPLETELY WRONG!

17:03.939 --> 17:03.973
Maho?

17:03.973 --> 17:04.735
Maho?

17:05.007 --> 17:06.976
All right, see ya!

17:06.976 --> 17:09.311
Rei looks like she's having fun.

17:09.311 --> 17:11.480
Occult stuff is her hobby.

17:11.480 --> 17:13.849
So "doing it for Behoimi" must be just an excuse.

17:13.849 --> 17:16.113
Oh my! Look at that!

17:16.285 --> 17:18.020
Th-The rabbit hutch!

17:18.020 --> 17:20.523
No one leave the classroom.

17:20.523 --> 17:22.625
If you do, I'll haunt you for
generations to come!

17:22.625 --> 17:24.992
Hey, how dare you leave the classroom
while I'm making a threat!

17:31.167 --> 17:32.965
Don't go near it! It's dangerous!

17:37.840 --> 17:39.108
Saotome?!

17:39.108 --> 17:40.176
How are the bunnies?

17:40.176 --> 17:42.211
Kurumi, how many does he have?

17:42.211 --> 17:43.474
Five!

17:44.113 --> 17:46.048
There are five of them! That's all of them!

17:46.048 --> 17:47.550
Thank goodness!

17:47.550 --> 17:49.785
Actually... there's still...

17:49.785 --> 17:52.321
What? There are more bunnies in there?

17:52.321 --> 17:53.189
Mesousa?!

17:53.189 --> 17:55.257
Now that I think about it, I haven't
seen him since last night!

17:55.257 --> 17:57.560
No, it's not Mesousa.

17:57.560 --> 17:59.153
Then, what's in there?

17:59.762 --> 18:01.196
Giant Salamander!

18:02.565 --> 18:03.766
Why?!

18:03.766 --> 18:05.801
I don't know...

18:05.801 --> 18:08.204
Anyway, we have to save him!

18:08.204 --> 18:10.472
He's a protected species, after all.

18:10.472 --> 18:13.175
All right, Kurumi, it's your turn to step in!

18:13.175 --> 18:14.476
What?!

18:14.476 --> 18:17.646
Don't worry, you can do it,
because you're quick-footed.

18:17.646 --> 18:19.081
What makes you think that?!

18:19.081 --> 18:20.349
Just shut up and go!

18:20.349 --> 18:23.552
Don't you care if the protected species
dies or not, Kurumi?

18:23.552 --> 18:25.111
That's so cold-hearted!

18:25.688 --> 18:27.520
Then why don't YOU go?

18:32.161 --> 18:34.823
Let me handle it!

18:34.997 --> 18:36.832
Whoa! Behoimi?!

18:36.832 --> 18:38.322
Get back, you idiot!

18:46.876 --> 18:49.072
Thank goodness, he's alive...

18:53.682 --> 18:55.284
Behoimi!

18:55.284 --> 18:57.920
Fire truck! Where's the fire truck?

18:57.920 --> 19:01.686
Oh... If only it would rain...

19:04.994 --> 19:09.632
Please God, at least him... at least him...

19:09.632 --> 19:11.896
Just save him at least!

19:19.742 --> 19:21.267
Rain?

19:25.648 --> 19:28.183
No way, the weather was so clear
just a second ago.

19:28.183 --> 19:29.318
A miracle...

19:29.318 --> 19:30.853
A miracle just happened!

19:30.853 --> 19:32.588
That's not it!

19:32.588 --> 19:36.558
It's magic! This is Behoimi's magic!

19:36.558 --> 19:38.260
Magic...

19:38.260 --> 19:42.254
Behoimi was a real magical girl all along!

19:47.937 --> 19:49.004
Maho!

19:49.004 --> 19:50.972
Behoimi!

19:51.273 --> 19:52.875
Behoimi!

19:52.875 --> 19:54.076
You did it!

19:54.076 --> 19:58.447
Well, it looks like we have a happy
ending, huh, Miss Miyamoto?

19:58.447 --> 20:01.075
Uh, yeah...

20:04.520 --> 20:06.579
So it was you guys.

20:06.922 --> 20:12.122
There was an urgent call for rain,
so I had my little sister help us.

20:13.495 --> 20:15.497
When did you get here?

20:15.497 --> 20:17.866
That was great, Behoimi!

20:17.866 --> 20:18.834
Oh, thanks...

20:18.834 --> 20:21.470
I can't believe you made it rain!
That's incredible magic!

20:21.470 --> 20:23.839
Oh, that was actually...

20:23.839 --> 20:26.108
It's okay. You don't have to hide it any more.

20:26.108 --> 20:28.110
W-Wait...

20:28.110 --> 20:30.010
Now I'm seeing you in a new light, Magical Girl!

20:31.613 --> 20:33.949
But we'll surely miss you...

20:33.949 --> 20:34.883
Huh?

20:34.883 --> 20:36.151
That's true.

20:36.151 --> 20:39.154
Even though you got to show us that
wonderful magic of yours...

20:39.154 --> 20:43.525
Now you have to go back to the Magical
Kingdom because we saw your magic...

20:43.525 --> 20:44.526
Huh?

20:44.526 --> 20:46.862
Take care even after you go back home!

20:46.862 --> 20:48.530
Write us, okay?

20:48.530 --> 20:50.899
Good luck with your magic training!

20:50.899 --> 20:52.731
Goodbye, Behoimi!

20:55.304 --> 20:56.805
Hey, look!

20:56.805 --> 20:58.273
Whoa, a rainbow!

20:58.273 --> 21:00.576
It's beautiful. Don't you agree, Behoimi?

21:00.576 --> 21:02.271
That's the rainbow YOU made!

21:12.755 --> 21:15.724
Moron! It's the same thing every morning!
Watch where you're going!

21:15.724 --> 21:16.225
Hrm?

21:16.225 --> 21:16.691
Hrm?

21:16.792 --> 21:18.894
Are you okay, Koichi?

21:18.894 --> 21:20.596
Huh? Who are you?

21:20.596 --> 21:21.563
It's me.

21:25.401 --> 21:26.935
Big Sis Behoimi?!

21:26.935 --> 21:31.640
The Behoimi you know has gone back
to the Magical Kingdom.

21:31.640 --> 21:34.701
So there's no magical girl any more.

21:35.377 --> 21:38.313
Oops! If I don't hurry I'll be late!

21:38.313 --> 21:40.714
Dash!

21:48.424 --> 21:54.295
Shalala, shalala, shalala, shalalico

22:05.507 --> 22:08.710
Ah, I'm a magical girl

22:08.710 --> 22:16.083
Everyone calls me “soothing”

22:16.952 --> 22:27.454
It's probably love, peace and dreams

22:28.831 --> 22:34.603
If I cast a spell, from the microscopic world

22:34.603 --> 22:40.372
To the end of the space, it's fantasy (fantasy)

22:41.276 --> 22:44.580
There, magical, magical, flowing with courage

22:44.580 --> 22:47.549
Shalala, shalala, 100 times more popular

22:47.549 --> 22:54.751
It feels great with pink aura

23:07.736 --> 23:10.501
Shalala shalalico kirakiralin!

23:14.143 --> 23:16.669
Please help me...

23:17.045 --> 23:18.513
Fight!

23:18.747 --> 23:20.875
Don't give me that!

23:21.350 --> 23:22.684
Fight!

23:22.684 --> 23:25.153
Please, I'm begging you!

23:27.956 --> 23:28.946
Oh.

23:31.527 --> 23:33.095
We're right in the middle of an exam.

23:36.532 --> 23:38.033
I'm Kurumi Momose from 1-C!

23:38.033 --> 23:38.200
I'm Kurumi Momose from 1-C!

23:38.200 --> 23:39.601
I LOVE running!

23:39.601 --> 23:41.036
I can forget about all the negative
things when I'm running!

23:41.036 --> 23:41.970
I can forget about all the negative
things when I'm running!

23:41.970 --> 23:43.772
Stuff like "I'm too normal" or "I don't have
much of presence" or "I'm plain"...

23:43.772 --> 23:44.106
Um... Be sure to watch the next episode, okay?

23:44.106 --> 23:44.239
Um... Be sure to watch the next episode, okay?

23:44.239 --> 23:46.241
Um... Be sure to watch the next episode, okay?

23:46.241 --> 23:47.042
Good night...

23:47.042 --> 23:47.342
Good night...
